<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 234 ALL OUT, ENGLAND 205 TO WIN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 234 ALL OUT, ENGLAND 205 TO WIN.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO, Zimbabwe 1996-12-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe were all out for 234 in their second innings, leaving England needing 205 to win the first test on the fifth and final day at Queen's Club on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores:  Zimbabwe 376 and 234, England 406.</p>
</text>
